# The boost gauge as the radar's rim (bottom centre). Full and amber; boosting (white) as it drains
# down both sides; the pause after (dim amber); refilling; then iso, where the rim shows alone.
wait 17
press c 3
wait 2
shot ring_full
keydown up
wait 0.3
shot ring_boosting
wait 0.7
shot ring_drained
keyup up
wait 0.2
shot ring_pause
wait 1.5
shot ring_refilling
press down
wait 0.5
shot ring_iso
